  "hypothesis": "P04f baseline-excursion and early-pretrigger effects are not purely artifacts of same-event duplicate transfer: they can be tested against downstream and A-stack external charge proxies, but the matched deltas are small or broad. The result supports retaining the anomaly labels as external-proxy risk covariates while abstaining from a stronger calibration-pulse or forced-random pedestal claim until true non-beam ROOT data are available.",
